  "elevationPhilosophy": "Elevation in this system is communicated through chromatic glow, not neutral shadow. Cards float on the dark canvas via a soft blue or violet halo (using rgba(64,91,255,0.2-0.4)) rather than a gray drop shadow. The only neutral shadow is reserved for the floating nav pill, which needs physical lift. This keeps the entire dark interface feeling like a single luminous surface rather than a stack of separated panels.",
