  "layout": "Full-bleed dark canvas with max-width 1200px content containers centered inside. The hero is a tall vertical block (80-100vh) with centered headline + subtext + form input stacked vertically with generous breathing room. Below the hero, sections alternate between two-column layouts (text-left / product-screenshot-right) and three-column card grids. The floating nav pill sits fixed at top center. Section gaps are large (80-120px) to let the dark canvas breathe between content blocks. Content rhythm: hero → logo strip → tabbed feature section (2-col) → code integration section (2-col) → resource card grid (3-col).",
